  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Grand Coven",
    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), you may pick 1 of these abilities to last until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins. Each can be picked only once per battle.\n\n- **Imbued Manifestation**: +6\" Range for ranged Psychic weapons of your **THOUSAND SONS** models.\n- **Psychic Maelstrom**: +1 to **Wound rolls** for attacks your **THOUSAND SONS** models make with Psychic weapons.\n- **Wrath of the Immaterium**: Psychic weapons of your **THOUSAND SONS** models have **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**.",
